    "created": "2026-10-10",
    "updated": "2026-10-10",
    "body": "# Dr Sam Illingworth\n\nAuthor of [[Critical AI Literacy|The Humanities Are the Moat]] (The Slow AI Substack). Holds a PhD in atmospheric physics — a decade spent measuring greenhouse gases from satellites — but credits reading poetry, not the technical training, with teaching the interpretive skills the role actually required.\n\nRuns the **Slow AI Curriculum for Critical AI Literacy**, a CPD-accredited twelve-month programme built around the evaluative skills described in [[Critical AI Literacy]] and [[Close Reading]].\n\n## Related Concepts\n\n- [[Critical AI Literacy]]\n- [[Humanities as AI Evaluation Training]]"
