    "created": "2026-10-10",
    "updated": "2026-10-10",
    "body": "# Ivan Illich\n\nPhilosopher who coined \"convivial tools\" — technologies people can repurpose, resist, and subvert in ways their designers never intended. Cited as the counterpoint to technological determinism in the [[Technology Neutrality Debate]].\n\n## Related Concepts\n\n- [[Technology Neutrality Debate]]"
