    "created": "2026-10-10",
    "updated": "2026-10-10",
    "body": "# Melvin Kranzberg\n\nHistorian of technology, best known for Kranzberg's Laws. The First Law — \"Technology is neither good nor bad; nor is it neutral\" — is central to the [[Technology Neutrality Debate]].\n\n## Related Concepts\n\n- [[Technology Neutrality Debate]]"
